Package: kapitan-ai
Version: 0.1.0~alpha1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Umut Korkmaz <umutkorkmaz.32@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 30
Depends: bash (>= 4.0)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/UmutKorkmaz/KAPiTaN-OS
Description: KAPiTaN OS Turkish AI command assistant
 kapitan-ai is a safety-first AI command assistant for KAPiTaN OS.
 Every proposed command passes through a static risk analysis harness,
 is presented with a plain-Turkish explanation, and is executed only
 via argv (never eval or bash -c) after explicit user confirmation.
